  "text": "## Learning & Improvement  \n**Root Cause Analysis:**\n- Identify systemic complaints (same issue, multiple customers)\n- Analyze root cause\n- Implement corrective action\n- Monitor effectiveness  \n**Examples:**\n- High \"slow processing\" complaints → Review SOP, add resources\n- Multiple fee disputes → Improve T&C clarity, better disclosure\n- Fraud complaints → Strengthen security measures  \n---",
